{"text":"And even as we acknowledge the world as it is, we must never stop working for the world as it should be, a world without nuclear weapons. That should be a goal for all of us. I believe if we're going to be true global partners, then our two nations must do more around the world together. So to ensure international security and peace, multilateral institutions created in the 20th century have to be updated for the 21st. And that's why I support a reformed United Nations Security Council that includes India as a permanent member. Of course, as I've said before, with power comes responsibility.","words":[{"text":"And","start":1.2,"end":1.64},{"text":"even","start":1.64,"end":1.84},{"text":"as","start":1.84,"end":1.98},{"text":"we","start":1.98,"end":2.14},{"text":"acknowledge","start":2.14,"end":2.46},{"text":"the","start":2.46,"end":2.66},{"text":"world","start":2.66,"end":2.84},{"text":"as","start":2.84,"end":3.0},{"text":"it","start":3.0,"end":3.1},{"text":"is","start":3.1,"end":3.4,"punct":","},{"text":"we","start":4.28,"end":4.54},{"text":"must","start":4.54,"end":4.74},{"text":"never","start":4.74,"end":5.34},{"text":"stop","start":5.34,"end":5.9},{"text":"working","start":5.9,"end":6.2},{"text":"for","start":6.2,"end":6.42},{"text":"the","start":6.42,"end":6.52},{"text":"world","start":6.52,"end":6.78},{"text":"as","start":7.34,"end":7.56},{"text":"it","start":7.56,"end":7.68},{"text":"should","start":7.68,"end":7.88},{"text":"be","start":7.88,"end":8.18,"punct":","},{"text":"a","start":8.26,"end":8.88},{"text":"world","start":8.88,"end":9.1},{"text":"without","start":9.1,"end":9.58},{"text":"nuclear","start":9.58,"end":10.06},{"text":"weapons","start":10.06,"end":10.48,"punct":"."},{"text":"That","start":10.9,"end":11.06},{"text":"should","start":11.06,"end":11.2},{"text":"be","start":11.2,"end":11.34},{"text":"a","start":11.34,"end":11.44},{"text":"goal","start":11.44,"end":11.6},{"text":"for","start":11.6,"end":11.76},{"text":"all","start":11.76,"end